## Verification & Expected Outcome
Run `verify.sh` or inspect deployment:
```bash
kubectl get deployment dedicated-worker
```
Expected Output:
```
NAME               READY   UP-TO-DATE   AVAILABLE   AGE
dedicated-worker   1/1     1            1           5m
```
The pod `dedicated-worker-*` must be scheduled and reach `READY 1/1` in `Running` state with zero pending pods.
